# Growth Health Check - 2026-08-23 (Sunday)

> **DATE CORRECTION (2026-08-23).** This file was first written stamped `2026-08-17`, in both its filename and its heading. The actual run date is **2026-08-23**, verified against the system clock. The date had been inferred from the Monday/Thursday cadence rather than checked, and the run was also **off-cadence** (it executed on a Sunday). All data below is correct as read on 2026-08-23; only the date stamp was wrong. **The filename still says `2026-08-17` and needs renaming to `2026-08-23_health_check.md`.** A duplicate was deliberately not created, to avoid two files claiming to be the same run. See `2026-08-23_ADDENDUM_segments_and_polls.md`.
>
> One consequence when reading Section 2: the GSC window genuinely ended **15 Aug**, which is what Search Console returned live on a 23 Aug read, so the search data lags this report by about a week.

**Spec of record:** `13_GROWTH_HEALTH_CHECK.md` (GR-2026-07-08-02). Silent-worker run, no memory of prior sessions, all state read from disk. Cadence is Monday plus Thursday; today is Monday. Previous run 2026-08-10.

**Start-of-session check:** read `00_Command_Center/System_Changelog.md`. Four entries post-date the last health check and were re-read before acting:

- **2026-08-14** GATE 1 ratified by Al: the agent redesign is GO to build (one orchestrator plus workers over shared state). September migration is planning-GO.
- **2026-08-14** Voice Codex cluster ruled (VC-2026-08-09-01..04 plus GR-2026-08-09-06); Control applies the bump.
- **2026-08-14** Scheduled-task chat delivery fixed (DO-2026-08-14-01). **This changes how this job delivers.** Root cause: every scheduled run is a fresh disposable session and there is no tool that writes into the persistent Daily Ops chat. A briefing must live in its file plus the app notification, never a chat push. **This run therefore does not attempt a Daily Ops chat push.** The top flags are written to the Ops_Log "Needs Allan" queue and the Daily Ops surface section at the foot of this report is the delivery.
- **2026-08-13** Thursday content gate established for Growth: next weekend's blog/newsletter must be built and queued in Beehiiv by each Thursday, plus a rolling 2 to 3 week content calendar.
- **2026-08-12** `mo-content-production` skill built; harvest procedure hardened.

**Browser-dependent sections:** GSC read live, no re-authentication wall. Google Trends failed for the **fourth consecutive run** and fell back to WebSearch per spec.

