## Daily Ops surface (top 3 flags)

Per DO-2026-08-14-01 there is no tool that writes into the persistent Daily Ops chat from a scheduled run, so these are delivered via this file plus the Ops_Log "Needs Allan" queue rather than a chat push.

1. **REVENUE LINE: `/advisory` is back on page one at position 7.6 with 19 impressions, up from 12 at position 10.2 a week ago, and still converts 0 clicks.** Free-chapter also improved (3 impressions, position 36.7). Meanwhile on-site views for both fell hard (advisory 24 to 15, free-chapter 35 to 22). Top signup source: **LinkedIn contributed zero for the first time**; the beehiiv recommendation network is now 4 of 7. The title/meta pass on `/advisory` is the action.
2. **Site conversion quality is degrading while traffic grows.** Sessions +20.9%, unique visitors +8.7%, but bounce rate at an all-time worst 48.59% (fourth consecutive rise) and session duration down 35% to 72s. LinkedIn sent 56 sessions and produced 0 signups.
3. **Subscriber input is not working.** The welcome survey is four months dry and the stream poll has been answered by 10 of 558 subscribers (548 sit in the "preference not set" segment). The Leadership stream router eased from 0 to 1 enrolment so it is not mis-wired, but the whole stream programme is running on a 1.8% sample.

**Also carried:** free-chapter still has no nurture automation (the one true funnel leak); the contributor pool is 63 said-yes against 4 ever contacted, unchanged nine weeks; Ahmed Elbendary's piece is nine weeks overdue; CHG-002/-005 pending five cycles; duplicate Signal Drop post live on two IDs, fourth run.

**Nudge for the period:** the advisory page has improved on its own two runs in a row. It is the only surface in this plan that has moved toward money without anyone touching it. Touch it.

**Availability status this run:** GSC read live, no re-authentication wall, all seven sections completed. Google Trends unavailable for the fourth consecutive run; WebSearch fallback used per spec. Recommend the spec retire the Trends step.
